Muse MiniMax Director original code is MIT-licensed. A2 ShotBuilder does not
embed Muse's Python ComfyUI node or its JavaScript timeline editor. Motion V1
reimplements a subset of documented timeline, chunking, and reference-numbering
ideas in TypeScript inside this Vite app.

The MIT license that covers Muse's original code does not apply to MiniMax H3
model weights. MiniMax H3 is a separate third-party model. See Muse's NOTICE:

  MiniMax H3 Community License Agreement
  https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3/blob/main/LICENSE

A2 ShotBuilder does not download MiniMax weights and does not run MiniMax
inference. ComfyUI workflow export is a graph-binding step only.
